+ * four, for the same texture object, in a 708-swap run). What the application puts in those faces
+ * is a smooth symmetric distance blob - mean depth 0.2773 in 0.0902..0.4431, identical on all six
+ * faces, which is exactly what an omni shadow blob looks like. Once our chain redirects that
+ * pbuffer, the same faces hold something else: 0.1180 with the face store, 0.4664 with store and
+ * latch together, with structure and hard black areas. From that it was concluded that opening
+ * the guard would destroy the store the hard shadows read, and the guard was refused. That
+ * conclusion is withdrawn, measured 2026-11-13: the reading above came from a chain that was
+ * delivering this cube badly, and what the closed guard really leaves in those faces is nothing.
+ * Two runs with identical probes and the same face dump, guard closed then open: on the 96x96
+ * depth cube faces the fraction of texels under two percent of luminance goes 55.06 to 0.00 and
+ * 56.62 to 0.00, distinct colours go 152 to 482 and 292 to 1116, and on the 80x80 face 1396 to
+ * 2851. A phase-controlled pair, 1280x720 window, every exchange captured: byte identical at
+ * exchanges 0 and 2, separating at exchange 4 where 27.44 percent of the sampled pixels change
+ * (6.23 percent brighter, 5.93 percent darker) and at exchange 6 where 67.33 percent change
+ * (20.68 brighter, 21.39 darker), so brighter where the indirect lighting fills in and darker
+ * where the shadow lands. The judgment at the screen says the demo's lighting system works with
+ * the guard open, indirect lighting and omni soft shadows included, and the knob is now turned on
+ * for Mad Mod Mike by run.sh while the code default stays off. The separate face store path still
+ * requires WINE_NV_PBUFFER_CUBE_FACE_FBO, which is enabled nowhere: on the same frames it moves
+ * 63.46 percent of the pixels and puts a giant dark rectangle over the room. */
+static BOOL
+nvlegacy_cube_store_depth( void )
+{
+    static int cached = -1;
+    const char *e = getenv( "WINE_NV_CUBE_STORE_DEPTH" );
+
+    if (cached < 0)
