+           * that drew, instead of Wine's store. Measured with value 1 the copy succeeds (16 copies,
+           * all result=1, tex 3 at 2048x2048 and tex 31/32/33 at 256x256) and the sampled map stops
+           * being all-zero: min=0 max=1, nz from 0.011 to 0.038 - but the mean stays 0.005 to 0.019,
+           * so 96 to 99 percent of the texels are ZERO, while the application clears depth to 1
+           * (10632 glClearDepth(1) calls in the reference dump). That says the store we read is not
+           * the surface the application cleared and drew into: the drawing goes to the system
+           * framebuffer of that context, so framebuffer 0 of the drawing context is the source that
+           * should carry the cleared background together with the geometry. */
+          if (nvlegacy_pbuffer_depth_copy() >= 2)
